{
  "id": "wizards-of-the-coast-employees",
  "name": "Wizards of the Coast employees",
  "category": "staff",
  "description": {
    "text": "Unlimited Fossil holos, with their 1999 copyright, in cosmos holofoil instead of the Galaxy Star foil of the released English cards; cosmos foil only reached English cards with Base Set 2 in 2000. All 15 of Fossil's holos are known this way. How they left Wizards of the Coast has never been documented, but every known copy traces back to the Seattle area, where Wizards was based, and the collectors who first showed them, some with all 15, say they got them from former Wizards employees. Collectors believe they were a test of the new foil. Unlike most test prints, they are cut like ordinary factory cards.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Elite Fourum: Rare English Cosmos Fossil holofoil",
